(6190472, 914251, 88235, '<td valign="top">a couple of thoughts on this pic...<br/> <br/>1. If you took this about 15 minutes sooner, the sky would have been a bright amazing shade of blue...<br/> <br/>2. Extended shutter would have been nice here. Doing an exposure where you only saw the blur of the car lights would have been attractive and ethereal.</td>', 'a couple of thoughts on this pic... 1. If you took this about 15 minutes sooner, the sky would have been a bright amazing shade of blue... 2. Extended shutter would have been nice here. Doing an exposure where you only saw the blur of the car lights would have been attractive and ethereal.', '2010-10-13 10:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
