(6190553, 914050, 54446, '<td valign="top">My fav in this challenge.  Really wonderful clarity, colors, detail, DOF.  Just a wow! image.</td>', 'My fav in this challenge.  Really wonderful clarity, colors, detail, DOF.  Just a wow! image.', '2010-10-13 11:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6190568, 913625, 54446, '<td valign="top">I think this is pretty good and I gave it an "8".  Just an observation, or two, about the horizon and perspective.  I observe you have squared the horizon of the tracks under the train.  That is a logical choice, but maybe not the best one.  The train is above your position and you are on the left bank of the river.  A natural perspective may have had a vanishing lines effect, with the train not on horizon square tracks, as viewed from your position.  My point is made by the water level, as measured at each bridge pylon.  Water seeks its own level and would be horizon square to your position.  So, the image needs a slight CW rotation.  You can see the train reflection in the water is really sloped up.  The actual train and the reflection should be equally sloped... and converging towards each other at a distant point to the far right.</td>', 'I think this is pretty good and I gave it an "8".  Just an observation, or two, about the horizon and perspective.  I observe you have squared the horizon of the tracks under the train.  That is a logical choice, but maybe not the best one.  The train is above your position and you are on the left bank of the river.  A natural perspective may have had a vanishing lines effect, with the train not on horizon square tracks, as viewed from your position.  My point is made by the water level, as measured at each bridge pylon.  Water seeks its own level and would be horizon square to your position.  So, the image needs a slight CW rotation.  You can see the train reflection in the water is really sloped up.  The actual train and the reflection should be equally sloped... and converging towards each other at a distant point to the far right.', '2010-10-13 11:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6190571, 914254, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great use of slow shutter speed to capture the movement of the train. I''m not too fond of the blue cast from use of tungsten or flourescent white balance. There''s a lot of noise grain, but I don''t think it detracts too badly. Way to make a mundane subject more interesting!</td>', 'Great use of slow shutter speed to capture the movement of the train. I''m not too fond of the blue cast from use of tungsten or flourescent white balance. There''s a lot of noise grain, but I don''t think it detracts too badly. Way to make a mundane subject more interesting!', '2010-10-13 11:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6190572, 914213, 79562, '<td valign="top">Nice Colors!  I wish the bridge was more prominent and that you place the horizon further down in the frame.</td>', 'Nice Colors!  I wish the bridge was more prominent and that you place the horizon further down in the frame.', '2010-10-13 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6190574, 914214, 79562, '<td valign="top">LOVE IT!  Good job waking up early to get this shot!</td>', 'LOVE IT!  Good job waking up early to get this shot!', '2010-10-13 11:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6190576, 913289, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a good subject but with the weeds being prominent in the bottom right corner I would have shifted my position to make the bridge more horizontal.</td>', 'This is a good subject but with the weeds being prominent in the bottom right corner I would have shifted my position to make the bridge more horizontal.', '2010-10-13 11:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6190579, 913852, 10785, '<td valign="top">The bridge is not quite as sharp as the foreground objects. I definitely like the long shutter speed. Sharpness is probably due to bridge movement. It looks pretty windy there judging by the flag.</td>', 'The bridge is not quite as sharp as the foreground objects. I definitely like the long shutter speed. Sharpness is probably due to bridge movement. It looks pretty windy there judging by the flag.', '2010-10-13 11:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6190595, 914231, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice color in the sky. Everything else is just dark with no real detail showing. You have a good shape with the bridge detail adding interest to the composition.</td>', 'Nice color in the sky. Everything else is just dark with no real detail showing. You have a good shape with the bridge detail adding interest to the composition.', '2010-10-13 11:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
