(6190798, 914321, 59796, '<td valign="top">A lightning in the shot! Very very cool - something that''s on my bucket list :)<br/>Hope you didn''t stay too long and get wet. Very nice shot - my top 10.</td>', 'A lightning in the shot! Very very cool - something that''s on my bucket list :)Hope you didn''t stay too long and get wet. Very nice shot - my top 10.', '2010-10-13 14:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
