(6190852, 914210, 46913, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the choice of B&amp;W, to be honest. It could have worked better in color, especially if messing with the white balance a little bit to create an interesting effect of some sort. Other than that, I do like the composition.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the choice of B&W, to be honest. It could have worked better in color, especially if messing with the white balance a little bit to create an interesting effect of some sort. Other than that, I do like the composition.', '2010-10-13 15:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6190857, 914186, 46913, '<td valign="top">An excellent, classy photo. The only reason for points marked down is lack of originality. :) From a technical perspective, it''s great, though.</td>', 'An excellent, classy photo. The only reason for points marked down is lack of originality. :) From a technical perspective, it''s great, though.', '2010-10-13 15:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
