(6191054, 914247, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen this bridge (or a very similar one) quite a few times from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=63398" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Nikonjeb</a>. If this is a Jeb entry, it is showing remarkably restrained usage of tonemapping. I''ll guess it''s probably from someone else in the same area.</td>', 'I''ve seen this bridge (or a very similar one) quite a few times from  Nikonjeb. If this is a Jeb entry, it is showing remarkably restrained usage of tonemapping. I''ll guess it''s probably from someone else in the same area.', '2010-10-13 20:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6191057, 914170, 23484, '<td valign="top">Love the B&amp;W and the processing.</td>', 'Love the B&W and the processing.', '2010-10-13 20:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6191058, 913335, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really like the use of a unique perspective on something so heavily photographed. A minor nitpick though: I think it could have used a touch more noise reduction to help smooth out that sky. Not sure if you could have done that without killing other details. Some NR software can apply it by color range, which would be basic legal.</td>', 'I really like the use of a unique perspective on something so heavily photographed. A minor nitpick though: I think it could have used a touch more noise reduction to help smooth out that sky. Not sure if you could have done that without killing other details. Some NR software can apply it by color range, which would be basic legal.', '2010-10-13 20:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6191061, 913287, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very neat looking bridge. Quite unique.</td>', 'Very neat looking bridge. Quite unique.', '2010-10-13 20:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6191063, 914254, 23484, '<td valign="top">Love the motion. Nice shot.</td>', 'Love the motion. Nice shot.', '2010-10-13 20:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6191065, 914152, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is upside down or rightside up. Very cool looking, though I should take off pointage for making me put a crick in my neck turning upside down. Nah.</td>', 'Not sure if this is upside down or rightside up. Very cool looking, though I should take off pointage for making me put a crick in my neck turning upside down. Nah.', '2010-10-13 20:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
