(6191070, 914086, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very unique perspective. Great job. 8</td>', 'Very unique perspective. Great job. 8', '2010-10-13 20:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6191072, 913783, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful b/w shot. You know of course, that the "border patrol" will nail you on this. It''s impossible to use a border without someone thinking it is "inappropriate" or a "disturbing trend". Myself? I think it sets the image off quite well.</td>', 'Wonderful b/w shot. You know of course, that the "border patrol" will nail you on this. It''s impossible to use a border without someone thinking it is "inappropriate" or a "disturbing trend". Myself? I think it sets the image off quite well.', '2010-10-13 20:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
