(6192507, 913788, 80904, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but I see a lighthouse not a bridge. Maybe youre trying to convey that the rail is a bridge. I guess techincally it could be, but I am having a hard time trying to see it.</td>', 'Nice photo, but I see a lighthouse not a bridge. Maybe youre trying to convey that the rail is a bridge. I guess techincally it could be, but I am having a hard time trying to see it.', '2010-10-15 14:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6192518, 913788, 59796, '<td valign="top">Always love lighthouses, especially at dusk/dawn :)<br/>Nice star bursts in the lights, nice reflection, a subtle palette on the sky, and the people for perspective. This shot''s got a lot to study - my top 10.</td>', 'Always love lighthouses, especially at dusk/dawn :)Nice star bursts in the lights, nice reflection, a subtle palette on the sky, and the people for perspective. This shot''s got a lot to study - my top 10.', '2010-10-15 15:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6192519, 914124, 59796, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective that conveys "heading into the city for the night". Subtle colors of the sky, fabulously lit up downtown skyline and the bridge itself - got a lot of nice things going for the pic - my top 10.</td>', 'Very nice perspective that conveys "heading into the city for the night". Subtle colors of the sky, fabulously lit up downtown skyline and the bridge itself - got a lot of nice things going for the pic - my top 10.', '2010-10-15 15:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6192521, 914214, 59796, '<td valign="top">The lighting through the fog is incredible - worth getting up early for! The composition is great - I so wish the crane didn''t block the view or attract so much interest in the picture - I suppose you couldn''t the drive the crane out yourself :D</td>', 'The lighting through the fog is incredible - worth getting up early for! The composition is great - I so wish the crane didn''t block the view or attract so much interest in the picture - I suppose you couldn''t the drive the crane out yourself :D', '2010-10-15 15:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6192523, 914083, 59796, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful view - the bridge just comes alive in the lighting. The wonderful palette in the sky complements the bridge well. I understand that the person provides a scale perspective, I just wish he weren''t so prominent and taking away from the bridge itself. Still, an unusual perspective of the Golden Gate (given the number of shots of it in this challenge). My top 10.</td>', 'What a wonderful view - the bridge just comes alive in the lighting. The wonderful palette in the sky complements the bridge well. I understand that the person provides a scale perspective, I just wish he weren''t so prominent and taking away from the bridge itself. Still, an unusual perspective of the Golden Gate (given the number of shots of it in this challenge). My top 10.', '2010-10-15 15:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6192524, 914041, 59796, '<td valign="top">Lights and an interesting sky! Nice timing.<br/>I would''ve liked to see the reflections some more - right now they are cut off mid-way and are distracting some what. But I understand that if you go wider, the bridge itself diminishes in the pic, so maybe you did the right thing.<br/>My top 10.</td>', 'Lights and an interesting sky! Nice timing.I would''ve liked to see the reflections some more - right now they are cut off mid-way and are distracting some what. But I understand that if you go wider, the bridge itself diminishes in the pic, so maybe you did the right thing.My top 10.', '2010-10-15 15:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6192530, 913642, 59796, '<td valign="top">No kidding! That sky looks like it''s already angry and pouring down a lot - hope you didn''t get wet trying to get the shot. That bridge seems super long from this perspective and doesn''t seem to lead anywhere :) Very nice composition and pleasing lines all around. I wish the nice still reflection weren''t chopped off so abruptly (no reflection at all would''ve been fine I think, so a crop off the bottom might work better).</td>', 'No kidding! That sky looks like it''s already angry and pouring down a lot - hope you didn''t get wet trying to get the shot. That bridge seems super long from this perspective and doesn''t seem to lead anywhere :) Very nice composition and pleasing lines all around. I wish the nice still reflection weren''t chopped off so abruptly (no reflection at all would''ve been fine I think, so a crop off the bottom might work better).', '2010-10-15 15:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6192531, 914251, 59796, '<td valign="top">If this was shot on Oct.9 (Saturday) night, then we probably met - I was there too, and got a tip from someone (you?) about climbing the hill on the side of the road. Ultimately I ended up not using this same shot, but it''s a very cool shot nonetheless. Great downtown and some interest in the sky as well. My top 10 for this challenge.</td>', 'If this was shot on Oct.9 (Saturday) night, then we probably met - I was there too, and got a tip from someone (you?) about climbing the hill on the side of the road. Ultimately I ended up not using this same shot, but it''s a very cool shot nonetheless. Great downtown and some interest in the sky as well. My top 10 for this challenge.', '2010-10-15 15:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6192532, 913576, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of an interesting subject and a good B/W conversion. <br/> <br/>It would''ve been good if there were some modern/tech elements in the picture. As it stands, there''s nothing in the pic that says "Bridging Science and Religion". However, the walkway sure does look like a literal bridge, so it definitely meets the challenge even if the subject of the pic were not a bridge. <br/> <br/>My top 10 for this challenge - hope you don''t get too many DNMC votes.</td>', 'Nice shot of an interesting subject and a good B/W conversion.  It would''ve been good if there were some modern/tech elements in the picture. As it stands, there''s nothing in the pic that says "Bridging Science and Religion". However, the walkway sure does look like a literal bridge, so it definitely meets the challenge even if the subject of the pic were not a bridge.  My top 10 for this challenge - hope you don''t get too many DNMC votes.', '2010-10-15 15:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6192539, 913924, 59796, '<td valign="top">Nice title - that''s what it looked like from the thumbnail :)<br/>The background beyond the bridge is a little distracting, so upside down (a cool idea!) works well in toning down that distraction and getting us to see the pleasing water reflection/tones first. Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice title - that''s what it looked like from the thumbnail :)The background beyond the bridge is a little distracting, so upside down (a cool idea!) works well in toning down that distraction and getting us to see the pleasing water reflection/tones first. Nicely done.', '2010-10-15 15:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6192547, 913843, 59796, '<td valign="top">Must''ve been a cool site - being under these gigantic arches.<br/>The second arch is kind of lost because the little sky underneath it is black and blends into the shadows almost. But the composition lines are very interesting, and primary arch is fabulous - so much detail and interest on it.</td>', 'Must''ve been a cool site - being under these gigantic arches.The second arch is kind of lost because the little sky underneath it is black and blends into the shadows almost. But the composition lines are very interesting, and primary arch is fabulous - so much detail and interest on it.', '2010-10-15 15:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6192548, 913576, 115644, '<td valign="top"><i></i></td>', '', '2010-10-15 15:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
