(6194135, 914263, 114225, '<td valign="top">Good use of available light. I don''t find a lot of interest in this photo. It seems more like a quick snapshot rather than something that is telling a story.</td>', 'Good use of available light. I don''t find a lot of interest in this photo. It seems more like a quick snapshot rather than something that is telling a story.', '2010-10-17 21:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
