(6194137, 914209, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very cool colors and nice perspective. I feel like this may have been over sharpened, as the details are staring to be lost.</td>', 'Very cool colors and nice perspective. I feel like this may have been over sharpened, as the details are staring to be lost.', '2010-10-17 21:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6194139, 914132, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a "prop" to add some  extra interest to the photo. However, I think this looks like a pretty cool bridge, and with the right perspective, it could have been super interesting on its own.</td>', 'Nice use of a "prop" to add some  extra interest to the photo. However, I think this looks like a pretty cool bridge, and with the right perspective, it could have been super interesting on its own.', '2010-10-17 21:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6194140, 914068, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m taking some extra time to decide if I like this or not. I do like the use of motion in the scene, but otherwise I think it feels a bit flat (the colors are pretty dull to me).</td>', 'I''m taking some extra time to decide if I like this or not. I do like the use of motion in the scene, but otherwise I think it feels a bit flat (the colors are pretty dull to me).', '2010-10-17 21:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
