(6194144, 914268, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great scene and well composted. The colors look like they should have a bit more impact. As is, they feel a little bit flat.</td>', 'Great scene and well composted. The colors look like they should have a bit more impact. As is, they feel a little bit flat.', '2010-10-17 21:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6194148, 913685, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, and a decent composition. I''m not sure, but it looks like maybe this photo could use a slight bump in contrast to bring out some of the details.</td>', 'Nice scene, and a decent composition. I''m not sure, but it looks like maybe this photo could use a slight bump in contrast to bring out some of the details.', '2010-10-17 22:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
