(6195822, 914026, 99263, '<td valign="top">This is of course not the famous "A bridge too far"  <br/>This is the Waal Bridge in Nijmegen. The actual bridge known from the movie "a bridge too far" which featured in Operation Market Garden during World War Two is in Arnhem and is now called the John Frost Bridge.<br/><a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Frost_Bridge" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Frost_Bridge</a> When the movie "A bridge too far" was made the actual bridge in Arnhem was not used because the buildings now surrounding the bridge are far too modern for depicting the era of World War Two. Instead the Wilhelmina Bridge in Deventer was used as it looks quite similar to the actual bridge in Arnhem.</td>', 'This is of course not the famous "A bridge too far"  This is the Waal Bridge in Nijmegen. The actual bridge known from the movie "a bridge too far" which featured in Operation Market Garden during World War Two is in Arnhem and is now called the John Frost Bridge.//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Frost_Bridge When the movie "A bridge too far" was made the actual bridge in Arnhem was not used because the buildings now surrounding the bridge are far too modern for depicting the era of World War Two. Instead the Wilhelmina Bridge in Deventer was used as it looks quite similar to the actual bridge in Arnhem.', '2010-10-19 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6195828, 914007, 102278, '<td valign="top">Lovely mystery. In my top 5 of the challenge. 9.</td>', 'Lovely mystery. In my top 5 of the challenge. 9.', '2010-10-19 19:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6195836, 913598, 120058, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but the post processing makes it look a bit noisy, especially in the dark corners. It''s really nice with the line the two bridges make but it would probably look better if it was in the centre at the top as well as at the end of the bridge.</td>', 'I like this photo but the post processing makes it look a bit noisy, especially in the dark corners. It''s really nice with the line the two bridges make but it would probably look better if it was in the centre at the top as well as at the end of the bridge.', '2010-10-19 19:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
