(6196492, 913642, 113606, '<td valign="top">Hey, congratulations!!!! Two ribbons in one week, you''re back johnny :)</td>', 'Hey, congratulations!!!! Two ribbons in one week, you''re back johnny :)', '2010-10-20 07:30:07.000000', NULL, 0),
