(6196498, 913924, 33361, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by David Ey:</b></div><hr/><i> looks upside down and for no good reason </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>how do you really feel? lol</td>', 'Originally posted by David Ey: looks upside down and for no good reason   how do you really feel? lol', '2010-10-20 07:35:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(6196514, 914325, 114565, '<td valign="top">I was aware that the photo was slightly tilted, I went to the sight twice and this was the best shot! I did mail DPC with my concerns about how valid the picture was as I am new to submitting photos and was unaware of the finer details of rules. I didnt hear back but I know that I have violated the rules for ''selection'' and am really very sorry. Thankfully the picture was not good enough to warrent any praise! Hopefully my next submission will do better! Thanks for your comments anyway x</td>', 'I was aware that the photo was slightly tilted, I went to the sight twice and this was the best shot! I did mail DPC with my concerns about how valid the picture was as I am new to submitting photos and was unaware of the finer details of rules. I didnt hear back but I know that I have violated the rules for ''selection'' and am really very sorry. Thankfully the picture was not good enough to warrent any praise! Hopefully my next submission will do better! Thanks for your comments anyway x', '2010-10-20 08:05:57.000000', NULL, 0),
