(6196655, 913525, 58430, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe:</b></div><hr/><i> glad I scored this one a 10.  DPC is not ready for real art - only topaz goosed to the nines and hdr toning.  we need another forum for art. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Amen brotha!!<br/> <br/>This is wonderful!!! I gave you a 10.</td>', 'Originally posted by oldbimmercoupe: glad I scored this one a 10.  DPC is not ready for real art - only topaz goosed to the nines and hdr toning.  we need another forum for art.   Amen brotha!! This is wonderful!!! I gave you a 10.', '2010-10-20 10:28:52.000000', NULL, 0),
